Tue Oct 13 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.6.4: Vantah remembers a new version that it found and
  shows the update banner again after a restart.
- While Vantah runs in the tray, it looks for a new version every day.
- The About window shows a link to the new version.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 12 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.6.3: use Avalonia 12.1.4, which fixes the duplicate
  tray icon and the crash on exit. Vantah no longer has its own
  workaround for these bugs.
- The Favorites submenu in the tray shows changes at once.
- If Vantah cannot save the favorites, it no longer closes.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 12 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.6.2: when the AdGuard VPN CLI disappears while the VPN
  is connected, the Status screen no longer shows the old location and
  speed, and the history no longer splits one session into two.
- The process window and the app log hide the SOCKS password and the
  DNS address.
- The AppImage contains update information (zsync).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 12 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.6.1: when the AdGuard VPN CLI is not installed, Vantah
  shows a clear screen that tells what it needs, and the app log no
  longer stores the SOCKS user name and password.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Sep  6 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.6.0: Vantah shows a desktop notification when the VPN
  drops and when it comes back, it can start minimized to the tray, it
  accepts the --minimized, --version and --help options, and a second
  vantah command shows the window of the instance that already runs.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Sep  3 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.5.0: in SOCKS mode with the kill switch the window no
  longer shows the Connect button while the CLI reconnects, short
  network outages are no longer missed, and Vantah can write its own
  log (off by default).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Sep  2 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.4.0: traffic is now counted in SOCKS mode, window
  transparency can be set in the settings, service windows have a frame,
  and SOCKS mode is no longer reported as disconnected.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Aug 14 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - bolikcraft <bolikcraft@gmail.com>

- Update to 0.3.7: a second tray icon no longer stays behind after the
  screen is unlocked or the machine wakes from sleep, quitting from the
  tray menu no longer crashes, and Avalonia is updated to 12.1.1.

